1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:09,325
A great cook with rotten tomatoes still makes a bad stew. In machine learning, good features matter more than the algorithm.

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:19,295
Turn categories into yes or no columns, and pull hidden features out of dates: the month, the weekday, the days to payday.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,600
For anything over time, train on earlier dates and test on later ones. Never shuffle the future into training.

4
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:38,575
And never use a feature known only after the outcome, like the number of debt collection calls, to predict default.

5
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:49,370
Scale with statistics from the training data only. Using test data is like letting students see the exam while revising.

6
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:54,770
If a score looks too good to be true, suspect leakage first.

